+# Pose package intake candidate
+
+Research-only GPL-3.0-or-later candidate; not an integrated import. Accepts hash-pinned user-supplied package and fresh private output name. It requires separately retained bounded DBPF and CLIP helpers. One real public pose package yielded 88 exact resources and 23 decoded clips. No creator package or generated media is included; arbitrary pose correctness, browser integration, game application and native saves remain unverified.
